      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html#getEvaluationContext(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.spel.ExpressionDependencies)\">getEvaluationContext</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\">ValueEvaluationContextProvider</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>rootObject</code> - the root object to set in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>.</dd>\n<dd><code>dependencies</code> - the requested expression dependencies to be available.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd>接口 <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\">ValueEvaluationContextProvider</a></code> 中的方法 <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html#getEvaluationContext(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.spel.ExpressionDependencies)\">getEvaluationContext</a></code></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>rootObject</code> - 要在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 中设置的根对象。</dd>\n<dd><code>dependencies</code> - 请求的表达式依赖项，这些依赖项将可供使用。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html#getEvaluationContext(java.lang.Object)\">getEvaluationContext</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\">ValueEvaluationContextProvider</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>rootObject</code> - the root object to set in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>",
