    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>source</code> - the root object for evaluating the expression.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a new <a href=\"ValueExpressionEvaluator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ValueExpressionEvaluator</code></a> to evaluate the expression in the context of the given\n        <code>source</code> object.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>source</code> - 用于评估表达式的根对象。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个新的<a href=\"ValueExpressionEvaluator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的接口\"><code>ValueExpressionEvaluator</code></a>，用于在给定的<code>source</code>对象上下文中评估表达式。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
